  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;particle,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;a.m.u and charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>e</mi></math>.</p><p>For proton,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;a.m.u and charge&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi></math>.</p><p>As the charged particle are moving through same potential, the kinetic energy acquired by the particle will be equal to electric potential energy i.e.,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>V</mi></math>, where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math>&nbsp;is potential.</p><p>Using the relation between momentum&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>p</mi></mfenced></math> and kinetic energy, we have&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>E</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>q</mi><mi>V</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Then, the ratio of linear momenta of two particles is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>p</mi></msub><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>p</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
